    "technical_renderer_regression_tested": true,
    "technical_browser_test": "Local Chromium with synthetic data: all five visible Technical Analysis tabs rendered; no page errors. The regression test fails against the v1.3.25 baseline and passes with this fix.",
    "v1326_live_read_only_scope": "Live v1.3.25 pages and account, futures, Market Explorer and Market Performance tabs checked read-only. Technical view reproduced m is not defined; repaired build not deployed. No mutation workflows or production-data reconciliation tested.",
    "v1327_lock_matching_search": "Local synthetic tests: rounded-paisa lock boundaries and extra precision, inclusive ranges and exact-date joins, both history scopes, 100-row pagination, SQLite and disposable local PostgreSQL, searchable filters, tab race, and Chromium mobile/dark layouts. Production data and live Aiven performance were not validated.",
